# Trust: Prishe (hidden quest TrustPrishe): a level 99 Warrior in the Tavnazian Safehold. The Walnut Door _0qa (no
# script; default DOOR_IS_LOCKED_TIGHT). CoP past Dawn (The Last Verse) with Dawn's Status 5 (setup). No permit: the
# default message. The Windurst Trust Permit (a GM): 633 (0, 0, 0, memories); the memories are the kept Lua reads: a
# fresh char answers 24 (hasCompletedMission with a quest log and ids 71 and 89 reads the Zilart log: true), then In
# the Mood for Love (+2) and A Chocobo's Tale (+4) completed (a GM): 30. Finished on 0: nothing; on 2: Prishe
# learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST. Learned: the default message.
lists TavnazianSafehold/_0qa/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/633
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=117,-42.8,43.5 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Cop TheLastVerse current
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 5
login
trigger _0qa                            # no permit: DOOR_IS_LOCKED_TIGHT
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit             # a GM
trigger _0qa                            # 633 (memories 24)
finish option=0                         # not 2: nothing
quest Jeuno.InTheMoodForLove completed  # a GM
quest Jeuno.AChocobosTale completed     # a GM
trigger _0qa                            # 633 (memories 30)
finish option=2                         # Prishe learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST
trigger _0qa                            # learned: DOOR_IS_LOCKED_TIGHT
